message: "If you use this software, please cite the version you used."
title: "Alertissimo"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Vujčić"
    given-names: "Veljko"
version: 0.1.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/sambolino/alertissimo"
license: BSD-3-Clause
keywords:
  - astronomy
  - time-domain astronomy
  - transient alerts
  - alert brokers
  - scientific workflows
  - data orchestration
abstract: >-
  Alertissimo is a research prototype for provider-neutral orchestration of
  heterogeneous astronomical transient-alert brokers. It separates scientific
  workflow intent from physical provider interfaces, normalizes broker responses
  into shared semantic structures, and preserves execution provenance.
